        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra tries to save Glimmer... But things don't go so well.&lt;br /&gt;Instead, Glimmer saves Catra from Horde Prime, knowing full well that Horde Prime needs her alive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, the group returns to Horde Prime's ship...&lt;br /&gt;To go save the Queen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
